# `STATECHART-GENRE-SCOPE` / `GENRE-NAMESPACE` `GENRE-VOCABULARY-OBLIGATION`: `statechart`'s allowlist is the scene host set and no more.
# It does NOT inherit `flowchart`'s three role keywords: a `decision` in a
# statechart is a category error (a state is not a test), and the allowlist
# rejects it with no per-keyword code — the same device 224 pins for the
# other direction. The scene keywords themselves are all in, so the same
# figure written with `node`/`edge`/`group`/`class`/`rank`/`flow` parses.
figdown 0.2 statechart
decision q "Valid?"
process p "Step"
terminator t "Done"
class mode "A mode of the machine" fill=#e0e7ff
state idle "IDLE" class=mode
state busy "BUSY" class=mode
transition idle -[start]-> busy
rank idle,busy
flow right
